Z||000009||84Bill||06-20-2001||05:45 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by PeaceDawg:<BR><B><BR>Now when I drive my car, after sitting for so long...well it just feels so good.  The Fiero is a car that makes people feel young.<BR>When I am cruising down the road at a good clip with the windows down and the stereo cranked I almost feel like I am in the cockpit of a rocketship.  Sure I could be driving another type of car but I sure am glad that I am not.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>One word to describe the above.<BR>Sublime.<P>During the cool nights in Florida I'd pop the roof off the Fiero and take a ride down Indian River drive just taking it easy, hoping not to get to the end of that winding road to quick. I'd drive from Ft Pierce to Stuart and back 20 miles one way just for the sheer joy of driving that car.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>||||reg||14
